  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Maybe one of the most peaceful and relaxing settings just east of Rosemary Beach, Fl at Phillips Inlet. The large spacious decks on both levels have lots of comfortable furniture for spending your days enjoying the Ocean Breeze. The first level decks have many places for you to relax in. The second level has awesome views of the gulf across the natural dunes. Ocean Breeze sits only 3 lots west of Helen Camp State Park conservation area. The beach access and dune walkover is approximately 100 yards to the east. You will find these beaches very secluded with lots of space to enjoy.<br><br>In front of the Ocean Breeze, is a large sandy area set up with Adirondack chairs and a fire pit for more family time after a relaxing day around the water. The homes is designed to sleep 10-12. It has a first level floor bedroom with a king bed and separate full bathroom. A 1/2 bath is also on the first level. The upstairs features 2 more bedrooms. Considered as a master, is another King bed with its own bathroom with views of the eastern sunrise and direct gulf views. Also on the second floor is another room that consists of two bunks that are made up of double bed with twin on top. (2 of these) This room has a direct gulf view also. Another bath room on the second floor features a shower and sink. <br>Our large pool was built in 2018 and can be heated. It is very family oriented and relaxing. We have a gas grill that is down by the pool area. In the front, we have hammocks and a firepit with chairs to enjoy.<br>This is a Saturday to Saturday rental during May to August. 5-7 nights minimum.<br>Other months vary.<br><br>The location of this home makes it close to all the 30A restaurants, shops, entertaining and different attractions. Pier Park is only a few miles to the east in PCB as well. Great home for bicycle rides or walks to many well known establishments! <br><br>***As of the beginning of Covid 19/ spring of 2020, construction has started on the lovely family owned land/dunes across the street. Please know this is beyond our control.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Ocean Breeze the place to relax and enjoy the ocean breeze!\nupdated 2023"
        }
      ],
